        <mxCell id="CtbqzY2CMxK35j-hzqa_-93" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="How to scale the Postgres for million transaction in a day:&lt;br&gt;We need transaction and retaional operatiosn so going ahead with the Postgres is natural but the challenge is scaling the DB to handle these transactions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;lets pick the Inventory DB: it should have multiple shards and we should deterministicaly know which shrad have which data so trainid + journey dat makes a good candidate." vertex="1">
